{"id":"f504685cd9dbe257","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion.md","title":"有限迭代跳跃的相对反演","display":"thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion — 有限迭代跳跃的相对反演","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion","aliases":["20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion"],"display":"thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion — 有限迭代跳跃的相对反演","chapter":"6","section":"6.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Corollary 6.4.5","source_printed_pages":[141],"source_pdf_pages":[175],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion — 有限迭代跳跃的相对反演"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 6.4.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>141</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45ca9c4551913b6a\" href=\"?note=45ca9c4551913b6a\" title=\"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion\">20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45ca9c4551913b6a\" href=\"?note=45ca9c4551913b6a\" title=\"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion\">20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\\ [\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)}=\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\\ [\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)}=\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 是上游相对准则。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}\\)</span>，先在底度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf c^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathbf c^{(n)}\\)</span> 上用一步准则，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n)}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d&#39;=\\mathbf d\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf d&#39;=\\mathbf d\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf b\\)</span>。再用归纳假设，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\">\\(\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)}=\\mathbf d\">\\(\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)}=\\mathbf d\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf d&#39;=\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf d&#39;=\\mathbf b\\)</span>，且结合律给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=(\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)})\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=(\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)})\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf b\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 6.4.5；印刷页 141；PDF 第 175 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion","status":"resolved","id":"45ca9c4551913b6a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion","status":"resolved","id":"45ca9c4551913b6a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-relative-friedberg-inversion]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}inversion}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c\\ [\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)}=\\mathbf b].","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf c^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf d\\ge\\mathbf c^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf d'=\\mathbf d\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\ge\\mathbf c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)}=\\mathbf d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf d'=\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=(\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n)})\\vee\\mathbf c^{(n+1)}=\\mathbf b","display":false}],"bytes":1638,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion]] — 章 6；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-292","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-iterated-friedberg-inversion]]"}],"outgoing":["45ca9c4551913b6a","e89